  "prompt": "PLACEHOLDER PROMPT (synthetic, replace with the real capture). We run a city bus depot. Every week each bus has maintenance jobs: brakes, doors, HVAC, tyres, engine checks. Five technicians, each with their own skills, work one job per day. Some jobs need parts that arrive mid-week. The workshop holds two buses at a time, and every job has a due day. Build me a SolverForge planner for this in my repo, and keep the plan stable when someone calls in sick.",
